===============================================================================
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
===============================================================================

This project is a C# re-implementation of SAI2 canvas decoding logic published
in libsai. The dpcm ("intg") canvas decoder, the jssf->JPEG rebuild and the
Huffman/quantization tables are derived from that project, therefore the
following notice applies to those portions (src/DpcmDecoder.cs,
src/JssfToJpeg.cs, src/HuffmanTables.cs).

